              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eitayutuo isinkan lenyena ninye te ngarri oo mbartan nenap ninche tenkae garri oo mbartan, neyau ninye Yerusalem. Neye ninye, nenukari ninye too nkuraren oo loo menye. Ore Yuda pooki o Yerusalem neishiraki Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eishiraka sii apa Yeremia Yosia, ore ilewa pooki o nkituaak pooki aranyak neranyu aalimu Yosia o metabaiki ena olong. Neitobir ninche enkitanapata te Israel, ng'ura eigero te mbuku oo nkishirat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nkulie kiaasin e Yosia, o nkiaasin enyena sidain te risioroto e nena naaigeroki too nkitanapat o Laitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o nkiaasin enyena e dukuya o kulie e siadi, ng'ura eigeroki ninche te mbuku oo laiguanak le Israel o le Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
